[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 24840.07, "timestamp": "06:54:00", "text": "因为这次合作。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24841.91, "timestamp": "06:54:01", "text": "因为这次合作，我才玩到了这款游戏。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24843.83, "timestamp": "06:54:03", "text": "我不知道会是什么样子。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24845.99, "timestamp": "06:54:05", "text": "我不知道。我只希望一切顺利。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24848.868, "timestamp": "06:54:08", "text": "今天发售。是啊，希望一切顺利。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24851.51, "timestamp": "06:54:11", "text": "因为我不知道这个游戏怎么玩。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24855.03, "timestamp": "06:54:15", "text": "所以，我也像疼痛一样。你看过吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24859.19, "timestamp": "06:54:19", "text": "有直播吗？我有个想法，呃，比如……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24861.51, "timestamp": "06:54:21", "text": "控制装置运转正常，而我们正在做什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24864.708, "timestamp": "06:54:24", "text": "应该这样做。呃，你好。希望你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24868.75, "timestamp": "06:54:28", "text": "做得很好。我忘了说"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24871.91, "timestamp": "06:54:31", "text": "那。谁能嘲讽我一下？我会烤"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24874.75, "timestamp": "06:54:34", "text": "你。呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24878.868, "timestamp": "06:54:38", "text": "是的。好的。我们之所以能玩到这款游戏，是因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24882.07, "timestamp": "06:54:42", "text": "今天合作的内容。我不知道是否"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24883.91, "timestamp": "06:54:43", "text": "这是一次不错的购物体验，因为我没有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24886.788, "timestamp": "06:54:46", "text": "我觉得我们都玩恐怖游戏。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24889.83, "timestamp": "06:54:49", "text": "经常。我们不。我这样做只是为了我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24892.948, "timestamp": "06:54:52", "text": "不要。我很少玩恐怖游戏"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24894.868, "timestamp": "06:54:54", "text": "我们刚拿到，但我感觉不像。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24896.548, "timestamp": "06:54:56", "text": "知道这是一次划算的购买还是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24899.27, "timestamp": "06:54:59", "text": "不，好吧，没事了。保留这